      <profiles>
        <profile name="Horrifying Beauty" id="a42a-f503-c51f-d5ec" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fight phase, once per phase per army, until the end of the phase:
  For each enemy unit: While the unit is a unit within Engagement Range of a friendly unit with the Horrifying Beauty ability, while the unit is below half strength, the unit must take a Battle-shock test, applying -1 to that test; unless the unit is below half strength, the unit must take a Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="6e29-bfbf-eceb-a193" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Fights First" id="5921-3d90-7fea-10cb" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the unit has the Fights First ability, the unit gains the Fights First ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
