        <profile name="Eldritch Flames (Psychic)" id="3a89-d621-9869-fa19" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence: that unit cannot benefit from Cover.</characteristic>
