            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">20</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">100mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Monarch of the Hunt" id="cf4d-c5e4-0450-39a3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; At the start of the battle round, if during the first battle round:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit, binding it as quarry selection (your Quarry target). When your Quarry target is destroyed, you must select one enemy unit, binding it as quarry selection to replace it. Only one such designation can be active for this bearer unit. For the rest of the battle, each time this model makes an attack against it, while making melee attacks, while that unit is tagged quarry, you can re-roll the Hit roll for attacks made by this model; you can re-roll the Wound roll for attacks made by this model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="No Prey Can Evade" id="48f3-afee-881e-c95f" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can re-roll the Charge roll.
You can re-roll the Advance roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="8ead-13f7-8a53-7a8b" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="15b9-5c2b-7790-eab0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Greater Daemon of Slaanesh (Aura)" id="a2a9-fdc0-3564-8896" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH unit is within 6" of this model, that unit counts as being within The Shadow of Chaos.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="5575-116d-5657-e22f" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
