          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="d9fa-7ddf-5de0-46aa" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="5538-1ddb-4591-3673" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Delightful Agonies" id="165b-c9d1-2d5e-58ad" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of each phase, if this model was destroyed this phase (1+ times), the first time this battle per model:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 2+, this model can be set up on the battlefield as close as possible to where it was destroyed and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, with its full wounds remaining.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Prince of Slaanesh" id="3ace-9565-0edc-0162" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, while making melee attacks, the unit scores Critical Wounds on Wound rolls of 5+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
