      <profiles>
        <profile name="Bane of Cowards" id="8bbb-b656-4459-260d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit starts a Fall Back move (the triggering unit must not have MONSTER or VEHICLE), while the triggering unit is a unit within Engagement Range of a friendly unit with the Bane of Cowards ability:
  -&gt; While the triggering unit is Battle-shocked, the triggering unit must take a Desperate Escape test, applying -1 to that test.
  -&gt; While the triggering unit is not Battle-shocked, the triggering unit must take a Desperate Escape test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="4f33-b643-5d28-fd07" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
