        <profile name="Daemon Lord of Nurgle (Aura)" id="7e87-cfc8-3968-1376" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE unit is within 6" of this model, add 1 to that unit's Toughness characteristic.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Nurgle's Rot (Psychic)" id="723c-0dd5-c49f-9904" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your Movement phase, you may use this ability, until the start of your next Movement phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit within 12" of this model: subtract 1 from that unit's Toughness characteristic.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="5181-435a-551d-e290" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Feel No Pain" id="ef84-d62d-8db0-2f32" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit has the Feel No Pain X+ ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="223d-3dd7-6f6f-c211" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Greater Daemon of Nurgle (Aura)" id="d454-93a2-d833-103e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE unit is within 6" of this model, that unit counts as being within The Shadow of Chaos.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="7e80-4029-5fde-0835" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
