          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Blazing Warpfire (Psychic)" id="cf77-fcbe-7bba-47a9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [ASSAULT].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Flames of Change (Psychic)" id="6926-3444-9df5-9bfc" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of your opponent's next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit does not have the MONSTER keyword and the selected unit does not have the VEHICLE keyword and the unit was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 4+, that unit is marked as aflame.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is tagged aflame, subtract 2 from that unit's Move characteristic.
    While the selected unit is tagged aflame:
      -&gt; This unit gets -2 to Advance rolls.
      -&gt; This unit gets -2 to Charge rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="fa81-0299-e651-1e84" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Manifestation of Destruction" id="ac20-b66b-af8a-7906" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit cannot be your Warlord.
The unit cannot be given Enhancements.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="9161-4341-36ae-4e3d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
