        <profile name="Blood Throne" id="e066-7cc6-df92-f5b7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fight phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit is within 18" of this model and the selected unit is visible to this model (your Blood Throne Target). Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly unit makes an attack against it:
    -&gt; Improve all friendly KHORNE LEGIONES DAEMONICA units' Strength characteristic by 1.
    -&gt; Improve all friendly KHORNE LEGIONES DAEMONICA units' Armour Penetration characteristic by 1.
    -&gt; Improve all friendly KHORNE LEGIONES DAEMONICA units' Damage characteristic by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Champion Slayer" id="737c-2f59-beb9-0ce9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While making melee attacks against CHARACTER or MONSTER targets, you can re-roll the Wound roll for attacks made by this model.
-&gt; Each time this model destroys an enemy unit with the CHARACTER or MONSTER keyword: this model regains up to D6 lost wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="f3ca-5347-8316-ad86" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
