      <profiles>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="3aee-42b3-2c15-a875" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Grotesque Regeneration" id="5471-1d9c-431b-db06" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of each phase, if the unit has the BEASTS OF NURGLE keyword, while the model has lost wounds, unless this model was destroyed this phase, until the end of the phase, set this model's Wounds characteristic to 7.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scouts" id="e532-80b7-677f-78a4" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Scouts X" ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="3f97-10ee-f57e-cee9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="The Shadow of Chaos" id="f8b4-70a8-c5a1-af65" hidden="false" targetId="1d05-942b-7d36-e2af" type="rule"/>
