    <selectionEntry name="Detachment" id="a435-b94a-eb7b-7c0c" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="22f4-cfa2-47c6-4beb" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="3e39-c5a0-9fd7-e3a1" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Configuration" id="db8d-f530-614f-5434" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="4ac9-fd30-1e3d-b249"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Detachment" id="e093-793f-6b81-22e7" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="85d5-86ba-071d-776a" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Blood Legion" id="21b4-7a36-fec6-b7ea" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="538c-63bc-3fc1-5873" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Murdercall" id="f082-1dc4-8532-1b17" hidden="false">
                  <description>Each time an enemy unit ends a move (the triggering unit must not have AIRCRAFT), during the Movement phase, in the opponent's turn, while the triggering unit is within 8" of a friendly KHORNE LEGIONES DAEMONICA unit:
  -&gt; Select one friendly KHORNE LEGIONES DAEMONICA unit within 8" of the triggering unit: that unit can make a Surge move of up to D6".</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Blood Tainted" id="2a37-5635-2a44-47ce" hidden="false">
                  <description>At the end of each phase, if 1+ enemy units destroyed this phase, while the unit is within range of an objective marker, if you control 1+ objectives, objective markers this model controls remain under your control until your opponent's Level of Control over them is greater than yours at the end of a phase.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Purge the Foe" id="91e3-4d42-fc5d-14e3" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="6fe0-3dbe-f7e0-10bb"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Daemonic Incursion" id="a7cf-90fa-4093-6047" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="f79e-0055-e6e0-87c5" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Warp Rifts" id="c1f9-218d-e0fd-7331" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly unit is set up (the triggering unit must have LEGIONES DAEMONICA), if the triggering unit is using Deep Strike, while the triggering unit is wholly within The Shadow of Chaos or while the triggering unit is wholly within 6" of a friendly unit with the BLOODTHIRSTER, GREAT UNCLEAN ONE, KAIROS FATEWEAVER, KEEPER OF SECRETS, LORD OF CHANGE, ROTIGUS, SHALAXI HELBANE or SKARBRAND keyword that shares the KHORNE, NURGLE, SLAANESH or TZEENTCH keyword with it, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 6" away from all enemy models.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="2884-819e-cdd9-043e" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="3"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Plague Legion" id="9ad0-91ee-ae18-b5aa" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="b942-6f8a-cd8a-0b19" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Melancholic Miasma" id="c72d-3007-76cd-050a" hidden="false">
                  <description>While an enemy unit is within 9" of a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA NURGLE unit, that unit counts as being within The Shadow of Chaos.
Select one enemy unit if the selected unit is within The Shadow of Chaos: during the Command phase, that unit must take a Battle-shock test.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="7564-d4fd-1f38-5ecb" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Shadow Legion" id="5063-25bd-d22e-665b" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="8bc1-586a-cf72-3206" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="First Prince of Chaos" id="c764-ae83-7699-0add" hidden="false">
                  <description>If your Army Faction is CHAOS DAEMONS:
  -&gt; All friendly KHORNE SHADOW LEGION units gain the Murderer’s Cowl ability:
    -&gt; Ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [ASSAULT].
    -&gt; The unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced.
  -&gt; All friendly SHADOW LEGION TZEENTCH units gain the Penumbral Puppetry ability:
    -&gt; The unit gains the Stealth ability.
    -&gt; Against melee attacks, the attacking unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.
  -&gt; All friendly NURGLE SHADOW LEGION units gain the Gloam Rot ability:
    -&gt; When the attack's S is more than the target's T, the attacking unit gets -1 to Wound rolls.
  -&gt; All friendly SHADOW LEGION SLAANESH units gain the Shadow’s Caress ability:
    -&gt; Your opponent cannot target the unit with Overwatch.
  -&gt; All friendly SHADOW LEGION UNDIVIDED units gain the Disciples of Be’lakor ability:
    -&gt; The unit gains Dark Pacts, whatever your Army Faction is.
    -&gt; If the unit has the BE'LAKOR keyword, the unit's Dark Pact rolls automatically succeed.
    -&gt; If the unit is a SHADOW LEGION HERETIC ASTARTES unit, the unit gains the Deep Strike ability.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Purge the Foe" id="22a3-a10d-3415-e89d" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="6fe0-3dbe-f7e0-10bb"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Scintillating Legion" id="dec0-c9cb-c265-cae0" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="fcb7-3e06-1847-7f19" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Fates In Flux" id="41c2-7127-0df2-4d38" hidden="false">
                  <description>If the unit has the LEGIONES DAEMONICA and TZEENTCH keywords, until the end of the phase, discard a die from your Flux tokens and use its value in place of a Advance or Hit or Wound or Damage or saving throw or Hazard roll.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="a0a8-5ff2-7718-1088" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Legion of Excess" id="24f0-3c89-41be-0675" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="0a43-6484-a507-01c4" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Beguiling Aura" id="b608-3b9e-7b7e-e62d" hidden="false">
                  <description>All friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH units are eligible to declare a charge even if they Fell Back this turn.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Seductive Gambit" id="9161-421f-3e2d-b7f4" hidden="false">
                  <description>All friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA SLAANESH units gain the Seductive Gambit ability.
-&gt; When the unit ends a Charge move, you may use this ability, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; The unit loses the Fights First rule.
  -&gt; You can re-roll the Hit roll.
  -&gt; You can re-roll a Wound roll of 1.
Applies to: units with LEGIONES DAEMONICA, SLAANESH.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="4510-d17f-6fdd-261c" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Cavalcade of Chaos" id="0dd1-86f6-d2a0-3aba" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="6d18-f5c6-f8cb-efb7" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Unholy Avalanche" id="a69d-3a3e-023b-3d54" hidden="false">
                  <description>If a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA MOUNTED unit fell back this turn, that unit is eligible to shoot even if it Fell Back this turn.
If a friendly LEGIONES DAEMONICA MOUNTED unit fell back this turn, that unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it Fell Back this turn.
Applies to: units with LEGIONES DAEMONICA, MOUNTED.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="b99c-14b8-9c1c-b462" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Lords of the Warp" id="6d62-2c41-fb3f-7d00" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="126b-bc54-4e6e-67b5" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Loci of Power" id="1def-48a6-a40e-0312" hidden="false">
                  <description>Improve all friendly CHARACTER LEGIONES DAEMONICA units (excluding MONSTER units)'s Leadership characteristic by 1.
Improve all friendly CHARACTER LEGIONES DAEMONICA units (excluding MONSTER units)'s Objective Control characteristic by 1.
Applies to: units with LEGIONES DAEMONICA, CHARACTER (excluding MONSTER).</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="eee1-3a58-5fa5-b051" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Warptide" id="357d-d51b-f001-a33d" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="5f17-3b45-06c8-35c2" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Shudderblink" id="14e3-4fb2-f76c-2251" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly unit is selected to make an Advance move (the triggering unit must have BATTLELINE and LEGIONES DAEMONICA), until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; Ranged weapons equipped by the triggering unit gain [ASSAULT].
  -&gt; The triggering unit is eligible to declare a charge.
Applies to: units with LEGIONES DAEMONICA, BATTLELINE.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Reconnaissance" id="f162-793e-e01c-5d9f" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="b4a7-5083-fe94-4d24"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
