              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fight phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit is a unit within Engagement Range of the unit:
    -&gt; Roll one D6:
